    "attributes": {
      "name": "Travel Itinerary Planner",
      "summary": "Planning a trip usually means notes in one app, maps in another, and no idea what it all costs. Travel Itinerary Planner puts the whole trip on one card: set a destination and dates, then build each day as a timeline of stops — every stop gets a time, a category, notes, and an estimated cost, and appears instantly as a routed pin on the live map. Costs roll up into a trip budget bar at the top, switchable between currencies.\n\nOpen the demo to see it shine: browse 2 Days in Bali, flip between the All days and Day 1/Day 2 tabs to watch the route redraw, then hit the pencil on any stop to edit its timing and cost — the map answers with nearby food and things-to-do suggestions. Press Plan with AI and the assistant drafts a full day-by-day itinerary for you, or link a Theme card like Midnight Voyager and the whole planner re-skins in dark navy and gold.",
